tdlib-android
=============

The binaries published by this repository are built from third-party source code. TDLib is modified only by
the source patches in patches/ (listed in tdlib.env); all other components are unmodified.

TDLib (Telegram Database library)
  https://github.com/tdlib/td
  Copyright Aliaksei Levin (levlam@telegram.org), Arseny Smirnov (arseny30@gmail.com) 2014-2025
  Distributed under the Boost Software License, Version 1.0 (see LICENSE).
  Modifications: patches/0001-parallel-file-hashes.patch (parallel upload.getFileHashes in TDLib's only-check
  download mode, option x_file_hashes_inflight) changes td/telegram/files/FileDownloader.h and
  td/telegram/files/FileDownloader.cpp and adds td/telegram/files/FileHashWindow.h. The modifications are
  released under the Boost Software License, Version 1.0.

